+/* The bar holds four spans and the right hand two share one slot, so
+ * space-between is wrong here: with a middle span empty it would centre
+ * whichever one had text. Pushing everything after the clipboard note away
+ * puts the count and the note together at the start and packs the rest at the
+ * end, which reads correctly whichever of the two is carrying text.
+ *
+ * The auto margin is on the clipboard note rather than on the count, so the
